---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import LivingScene from '../components/LivingScene.astro';
import '../styles/editorial-pages.css';
---
<Base title="关于我" description="吟处雪轻遮，一名正在学习与探索的技术美术。">
  <header class="page-stage signal-stage"><LivingScene variant="about"/><div class="stage-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="signal-copy"><span class="stage-index">04 / HELLO FROM HERE</span><h1 data-kinetic data-kinetic-style="wide">SIGNAL</h1><p class="stage-subtitle" data-kinetic data-kinetic-style="ink">关于我</p><p class="signal-description">在技术与画面之间，<br/>寻找自己的语言。</p></div><div class="signal-chart" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 440 410"><defs><radialGradient id="signal-glow"><stop stop-color="currentColor" stop-opacity=".16"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="currentColor" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs><circle cx="225" cy="205" r="180" fill="url(#signal-glow)"/><circle class="signal-ring" cx="225" cy="205" r="155"/><circle class="signal-ring signal-ring-inner" cx="225" cy="205" r="113"/><path class="signal-path" d="M92 172 169 93 278 110 355 220 289 322 193 283 128 335 M169 93 193 283 278 110 M92 172 355 220 193 283 M278 110 289 322"/>{[[92,172],[169,93],[278,110],[355,220],[289,322],[193,283],[128,335]].map(([x,y],i)=><g class="signal-star" style={`--star-delay:${i*.5}s`}><circle cx={x} cy={y} r={i===2?6:3}/><circle class="signal-star-halo" cx={x} cy={y} r="11"/></g>)}<path class="signal-signature" d="M125 227 C149 204 163 176 163 183 C158 210 126 258 143 248 C166 233 182 210 195 207 C175 234 176 250 194 239 C212 229 225 196 236 193 L217 242 L252 208 L237 239 C261 225 279 211 293 205 L272 237 L309 220"/><text x="333" y="88" class="signal-label">MAKE</text><text x="58" y="283" class="signal-label">LEARN</text><text x="310" y="342" class="signal-label">REPEAT</text></svg></div></header>
  <article class="about-layout">
    <aside class="about-margin" aria-label="个人简介"><div class="profile-name" data-kinetic data-kinetic-style="ink">吟处<br/>雪轻遮</div><p class="profile-intro">正在学习与探索的技术美术，<br/>这些手记的记录者。</p><div class="profile-status"><span></span>保持好奇，持续探索</div><p>TECHNICAL ART<br/>SHADER & NPR<br/>ALWAYS LEARNING</p></aside>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <section data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">THE THINGS I CARE ABOUT</span><h2>好看的画面，总让人想再靠近一点。</h2><p>我喜欢风格化的角色与场景，也好奇它们背后的实现：一道描边如何贴合轮廓，阴影怎样保留表情，光照又如何把颜色连成一个整体。</p><p>于是从建模与场景练习出发，慢慢走向实时渲染、NPR 卡通着色与 Shader。现在的探索围绕 Unity URP、Unreal Engine 与 Blender 展开，既关心最终的画面，也关心让这些画面成为可能的数学、代码与工具。</p></section>
      <section data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">A PLACE TO KEEP THINGS</span><h2>给学习留下痕迹。</h2><p>这个小站收纳作品，也收纳过程。做出来的效果、拆解过的算法、走过的弯路，都值得留在这里。文章可能带着当时理解的局限，之后有了新的认识，再回来补上。</p><div class="about-paths"><a href="/work/"><span>看作品</span><p>角色渲染、管线实验与工具实践</p></a><a href="/notes/"><span>读手记</span><p>推导、源码阅读和问题记录</p></a><a href="/tutorials/"><span>一起学习</span><p>沿着专题，把理解一点点搭起来</p></a></div></section>
      <section id="visual" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">ON THE WORK</span><h2>关于这里的作品。</h2><p>这里的项目包含个人练习、渲染复现与工具制作。涉及游戏角色、模型和其他原作素材时，原作权利属于各自的创作者；具体的实现过程与引用信息请以对应文章为准。</p></section>
      <section id="contact" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">LET'S KEEP IN TOUCH</span><h2>如果你也对这些感兴趣。</h2><p>欢迎交流图形学与技术美术，也欢迎指出文章里的疏漏。</p><div class="contact-links"><a href="https://github.com/XueQingZhe">GitHub</a><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/93-66-30-25">知乎</a><a href="mailto:1215422936@qq.com">写封邮件</a><a href="https://qm.qq.com/q/kYwCma6AAY">QQ 交流群</a><a href="/rss.xml">订阅 RSS</a></div></section>
      <p class="about-signature" data-kinetic>吟处雪轻遮<span>谢谢你在这里停留。</span></p>
      <p class="visual-credit">水庭入口与栏目景观由网页中的图形程序实时绘制。项目图像、模型素材与引用信息见对应文章。</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
<style>
  .signal-stage{min-height:475px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;align-items:center;padding:35px 50px;margin-top:24px}.signal-copy{position:relative;z-index:2}.signal-copy .stage-index{display:block;margin-bottom:35px}.signal-copy h1{font:800 clamp(70px,10vw,148px)/.9 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.075em;margin:0}.signal-copy .stage-subtitle{font:700 28px var(--font-art,var(--font-display));letter-spacing:.15em;margin:24px 0 0}.signal-description{font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink-2);margin:25px 0 0}.signal-chart{position:relative;z-index:2;color:var(--accent)}.signal-chart svg{width:100%;height:auto;overflow:visible}.signal-ring{stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:.8;stroke-dasharray:2 9;opacity:.32}.signal-ring-inner{stroke-dasharray:none;opacity:.16}.signal-path{stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:.8;opacity:.4}.signal-star circle{fill:currentColor}.signal-star .signal-star-halo{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:.5;opacity:.3;animation:signal-breathe 4s ease-in-out var(--star-delay) infinite alternate}.signal-signature{fill:none;stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:650;stroke-dashoffset:650;animation:signal-write 4s 1s ease forwards}.signal-label{fill:var(--ink-3);font:7px var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:2px}@keyframes signal-write{to{stroke-dashoffset:0}}@keyframes signal-breathe{to{opacity:.85;stroke-width:1.3}}.profile-name{font:800 49px/1.3 var(--font-art,var(--font-display));letter-spacing:-.08em;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:25px}.about-margin .profile-intro{font:12px/1.9 var(--font-body);letter-spacing:0;margin:0 0 25px;color:var(--ink-2)}.profile-status{font-size:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;color:var(--ink-2)}.profile-status>span{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}
  :global(html[data-motion=paused]) .signal-star-halo{animation-play-state:paused}
  :global(html[data-motion=paused]) .signal-signature{animation:none;stroke-dashoffset:0}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.signal-signature{animation:none;stroke-dashoffset:0}.signal-star .signal-star-halo{animation:none}}
  .about-copy .visual-credit{font-size:10px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink-3);padding-top:25px;margin-top:35px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.visual-credit a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .about-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(160px,1fr) minmax(0,2fr);gap:85px;margin-top:63px;max-width:1080px}.about-margin{padding-top:5px}.about-monogram{font:400 116px/1.15 var(--font-display);color:var(--accent);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:25px;max-width:220px}.about-monogram span{display:block;margin-top:25px;font:400 10px/1.8 var(--font-body);letter-spacing:6px;color:var(--ink-3)}.about-margin>p{font:400 9px/2.5 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:1.6px;color:var(--ink-3);margin-top:25px}.about-copy section+section{margin-top:60px}.about-copy h2{font:700 26px/1.5 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:17px 0 22px;text-wrap:balance}.about-copy p{font-size:14px;line-height:2.15;color:var(--ink-2);margin:0 0 18px}.about-paths{margin-top:30px}.about-paths a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:82px minmax(0,1fr);align-items:baseline;gap:15px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:17px 0;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.about-paths a:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.about-paths a>span{font:500 15px var(--font-display)}.about-paths a>p{margin:0;font-size:12px}.about-paths i{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent);text-align:right}.about-paths a:hover>span{color:var(--accent)}.contact-links{display:flex;gap:15px 25px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:27px}.contact-links a{font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:5px}.contact-links a>span{margin-left:12px}.contact-links a:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}.about-copy .about-signature{font:500 24px/1.5 var(--font-display);color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:70px}.about-signature>span{display:block;font:400 11px/1.8 var(--font-body);color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:15px}
  @media(max-width:760px){.signal-stage{padding:40px 25px 0;grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:0}.signal-copy .stage-index{margin-bottom:25px}.signal-copy h1{font-size:clamp(72px,18vw,120px)}.signal-copy .stage-subtitle{font-size:23px;margin-top:18px}.signal-description{font-size:11px;margin-top:18px}.signal-chart{max-width:300px;width:100%;justify-self:end;margin-top:-95px;margin-right:-22px;opacity:.65}.about-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px;margin-top:35px}.about-margin{display:block;padding-bottom:30px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.profile-name{font-size:35px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0}.profile-name br{display:none}.about-margin>p:last-child{display:none}.about-copy h2{font-size:23px}.about-copy p{font-size:13px}.about-copy section+section{margin-top:42px}.about-paths a{grid-template-columns:75px minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px}.about-paths a>p{font-size:11px}.contact-links{gap:16px 23px}}
  /* Readability adjustments retain the original quiet, two-column composition. */
  .signal-description{font-size:13px}
  .signal-label{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.5px}
  .profile-status{font-size:11px}
  .about-margin .profile-intro{font-size:13px}
  .about-copy p{font-size:15px;line-height:2.05}
  .about-copy .visual-credit{font-size:11px;line-height:1.9}
  .contact-links a{font-size:13px;min-height:40px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}
  .about-paths a>p{font-size:13px}
  .about-copy .about-signature{font-family:var(--font-art,var(--font-display));font-size:30px;letter-spacing:2px}
  @media(max-width:760px){
    .signal-description{font-size:12px}
    .about-copy p{font-size:14px}
    .about-paths a>p{font-size:12px}
    .contact-links{gap:10px 23px}
    .about-copy .about-signature{font-size:27px}
  }
</style>
